  "rationale": "All tasks must execute; this is not selecting maximum reward, optimizing one ordering, or enumerating arbitrary idle times. Release times and nonpreemption make a fixed order’s earliest schedule the correct feasibility certificate.",
  "commonMistakes": [
    "ignore-release-times",
    "treat-deadline-as-exclusive",
    "ignore-deadline-failures"
  ],
